      "type": "list",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 113,
      "raw": "* $DC = 0$（$C$是一个常数）\n* $Dx^n = nx^{n-1}$（*幂律*（power rule），$n$是任意实数）\n* $De^x = e^x$\n* $D\\ln(x) = 1/x$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 6,
        "rendered": 6,
        "errors": 0,
