    {
      "id": "calculus-042",
      "sha256": "cb7840586d79e03f24ea092328ca6cc63824d86b96a0de1d3abd48634196bb02",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 228,
      "raw": "到目前为止，我们只讨论了仅含一个变量的函数的微分。\n在深度学习中，函数通常依赖于许多变量。\n因此，我们需要将微分的思想推广到*多元函数*（multivariate function）上。",
      "math": {
        "expected": 0,
        "rendered": 0,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculus-043",
      "sha256": "0f245ea0214dd9b1c2a202a1f8a2b45a9c2ac733b1fc8d7f9a36adae23497e3e",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 232,
      "raw": "设$y = f(x_1, x_2, \\ldots, x_n)$是一个具有$n$个变量的函数。\n$y$关于第$i$个参数$x_i$的*偏导数*（partial derivative）为：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 5,
        "rendered": 5,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculus-044",
      "sha256": "4546552a6e9f0e23ee87c8cc5ff3ffc1263cbd0efbc14386570b2536c13d09c8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 235,
      "raw": "$$ \\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x_i} = \\lim_{h \\rightarrow 0} \\frac{f(x_1, \\ldots, x_{i-1}, x_i+h, x_{i+1}, \\ldots, x_n) - f(x_1, \\ldots, x_i, \\ldots, x_n)}{h}.$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculus-045",
      "sha256": "d47a267c626b4252046270a0e4f091c1f859f7dbe715bf02e8a9a4acedc54304",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 237,
      "raw": "为了计算$\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x_i}$，\n我们可以简单地将$x_1, \\ldots, x_{i-1}, x_{i+1}, \\ldots, x_n$看作常数，\n并计算$y$关于$x_i$的导数。\n对于偏导数的表示，以下是等价的：",
      "math": {
        "expected": 4,
        "rendered": 4,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculus-046",
      "sha256": "7f7f1f01af548c16ba1dbece53eb29be6ea140e4178a87c45a851518c4049cca",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "depth": null,
      "line": 242,
      "raw": "$$\\frac{\\partial y}{\\partial x_i} = \\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial x_i} = f_{x_i} = f_i = D_i f = D_{x_i} f.$$",
      "math": {
        "expected": 1,
        "rendered": 1,
        "errors": 0,
        "pending": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "calculus-047",
      "sha256": "c1b267e9cace43aa9a7232a23297a3eb78397e1ca2efc948e75ada0b9864aa41",
      "type": "heading",
      "depth": 2,
      "line": 244,
      "raw": "## 梯度",
      "math": {
        "expected": 0,
        "rendered": 0,
